DESCRIPTION:The official updated 22nd-anniversary flyer says Thursday\, December 17\, 6–10 AM\; the organizer labels its image BE_ToysForTots 2026_650x800.jpg. December 17\, 2026 is Thursday. The official page confirms new\, unwrapped toys\, Norwood address and donation deadline of 9 AM December 17. This supersedes older December 5\, 2025 and drive-through annual announcements. Collection before broadcast: sales/showroom hours Monday–Friday 9 AM–6 PM\, Saturday 9 AM–5 PM\, Sunday closed\; confirm holiday exceptions with the host. No flyer copy retained.\nSource: https://www.bochexotics.com/toys-for-tots-at-boch-exotics-norwood-ma.htm
